<BaseLayout title="LEGO-Compatible Lighting Kits | Buy Better Finds" description="Explore BRKOX LED lighting accessories for LEGO builds, organized by compatible set number. LEGO sets sold separately.">
<main class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem 5rem">
<p><a href="/categories/gifts-collectibles/">← Gifts &amp; Collectibles</a></p>
<h1>Lighting kits for LEGO® displays</h1>
<p>Make your completed build shine. These independent BRKOX lighting accessories are designed for specific LEGO® set numbers. <strong>These listings are for lighting kits only; LEGO sets are not included.</strong></p>
<p style="font-size:.9rem">Disclosure: We may earn a commission when you purchase through BRKOX links on this page. LEGO® is a trademark of the LEGO Group; BRKOX lighting kits are independent accessories, not official LEGO® products.</p>
<div class="kit-grid">
{kits.map(kit => <article class="kit-card"><span class="set">Compatible set #{kit.set}</span><h2>{kit.name}</h2><p>Confirm your set number and select the lighting version on BRKOX before ordering.</p><a class="kit-link" href={affiliate(kit.url)} target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">View lighting kit at BRKOX →</a></article>)}
</div>
<p>More products and verified manufacturer images will be added as their individual listings are checked. No substitute or placeholder product imagery is used.</p>
</main>
<style>
.kit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:1.25rem;margin:2rem 0}.kit-card{border:1px solid #d9dfe8;border-radius:14px;padding:1.5rem;background:white;color:#17243b}.kit-card h2{font-size:1.25rem;margin:.7rem 0}.kit-card p{line-height:1.55}.set{font-size:.85rem;color:#56667c}.kit-link{display:inline-block;background:#003087;color:white;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;margin-top:.6rem}
